# The checkers and formatters setup.sh installs into /opt/cf-tools, pinned.
# A release of any of them can find something new, so a version changes here,
# in CI (.github/workflows/ci.yml) and in the tree's fixes together.
# `python3 scripts/buildenv/requirements-lock.py tools` makes tools-requirements.txt.
